config HM_COMMON
	bool "HM common support library (voter, event bus)"
	help
	  Shared support library of the hm modules: the voter voting
	  framework and the hm_event inter-module event bus.

	  Notes:
	  - This is bool, not tristate, matching the all-builtin policy of
	    the hm modules (a =m library with =y consumers would fail to
	    link; do not create that trap);
	  - voter.o and hm_event.o are built exactly once for the whole
	    kernel; modules use them through the headers and exported
	    symbols, and must NEVER compile the sources of this directory
	    again in their own Makefiles (duplicate copies would split the
	    votable name registry and find_votable() would never find the
	    votables created by other modules).

	  Each hm module's Kconfig should depend on HM_COMMON.
